{
 "id": "seg3",
 "title": "舍入方向",
 "pill": 3,
 "total": 159.29,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg3-00",
   "text": "整数除法会丢掉余数。问题是，余数归谁。",
   "spoken": "整数除法会丢掉余数。问题是，余数归谁。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg3-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 5.4,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 6.16
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-01",
   "text": "规则只有一条：余数归协议，不归调用者。",
   "spoken": "规则只有一条：余数归协议，不归掉用者。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg3-01.mp3",
   "start": 7.22,
   "dur": 4.56,
   "speechStart": 7.318,
   "speechEnd": 10.96
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-02",
   "text": "拿 ERC-4626 金库来看，四个函数，四个方向。",
   "spoken": "拿 ERC-4626 金库来看，四个函数，四个方向。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg3-02.mp3",
   "start": 12.0,
   "dur": 5.112,
   "speechStart": 12.098,
   "speechEnd": 16.276
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-03",
   "text": "deposit，用户给资产，拿份额。份额向下取整，少给。",
   "spoken": "deposit，用户给资产，拿份额。份额向下取整，少给。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg3-03.mp3",
   "start": 17.332,
   "dur": 6.36,
   "speechStart": 17.43,
   "speechEnd": 22.868
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-04",
   "text": "mint，用户指定份额，算要付多少资产。资产向上取整，多收。",
   "spoken": "mint，用户指定份额，算要付多少资产。资产向上取整，多收。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg3-04.mp3",
   "start": 23.912,
   "dur": 6.84,
   "speechStart": 24.01,
   "speechEnd": 29.924
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-05",
   "text": "withdraw，用户指定资产，算要扣多少份额。份额向上取整，多扣。",
   "spoken": "withdraw，用户指定资产，算要扣多少份额。份额向上取整，多扣。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg3-05.mp3",
   "start": 30.972,
   "dur": 7.296,
   "speechStart": 31.07,
   "speechEnd": 37.424
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-06",
   "text": "redeem，用户交出份额，拿资产。资产向下取整，少给。",
   "spoken": "redeem，用户交出份额，拿资产。资产向下取整，少给。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg3-06.mp3",
   "start": 38.488,
   "dur": 6.648,
   "speechStart": 38.586,
   "speechEnd": 44.309
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-07",
   "text": "记成一句话：给出去的，向下；收进来的，向上。",
   "spoken": "记成一句话：给出去的，向下；收进来的，向上。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg3-07.mp3",
   "start": 45.356,
   "dur": 5.736,
   "speechStart": 45.454,
   "speechEnd": 50.251
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-08",
   "text": "方向反了会怎样？攻击者可以做往返套利。",
   "spoken": "方向反了会怎样？攻击者可以做往返套利。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg3-08.mp3",
   "start": 51.312,
   "dur": 4.32,
   "speechStart": 51.41,
   "speechEnd": 54.8
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-09",
   "text": "反复 mint 1 份额，再 redeem，每次净赚 1 个单位的舍入误差。",
   "spoken": "反复 mint 1 份额，再 redeem，每次净赚 1 个单位的舍入误差。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg3-09.mp3",
   "start": 55.852,
   "dur": 5.328,
   "speechStart": 55.95,
   "speechEnd": 60.342
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-10",
   "text": "单次很小。但在没有手续费的场景下，可以循环上千次。",
   "spoken": "单次很小。但在没有手续费的场景下，可以循环上千次。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg3-10.mp3",
   "start": 61.4,
   "dur": 5.64,
   "speechStart": 61.498,
   "speechEnd": 66.186
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-11",
   "text": "打个比方。披萨店按块卖，一张披萨切 8 块。",
   "spoken": "打个比方。披萨店按块卖，一张披萨切 8 块。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg3-11.mp3",
   "start": 67.26,
   "dur": 4.992,
   "speechStart": 67.358,
   "speechEnd": 71.415
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-12",
   "text": "你付三分之一张的钱，店员要决定，给你 2 块还是 3 块。",
   "spoken": "你付三分之一张的钱，店员要决定，给你 2 块还是 3 块。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg3-12.mp3",
   "start": 72.472,
   "dur": 5.352,
   "speechStart": 72.57,
   "speechEnd": 76.998
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-13",
   "text": "如果店员总往多了给，聪明的顾客，就反复买三分之一张。",
   "spoken": "如果店员总往多了给，聪明的顾客，就反复买三分之一张。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg3-13.mp3",
   "start": 78.044,
   "dur": 5.136,
   "speechStart": 78.142,
   "speechEnd": 82.344
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-14",
   "text": "比方在这里不成立：披萨店会被投诉。",
   "spoken": "比方在这里不成立：披萨店会被投诉。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg3-14.mp3",
   "start": 83.4,
   "dur": 3.72,
   "speechStart": 83.498,
   "speechEnd": 86.283
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-15",
   "text": "合约里，多拿 1 wei 的操作，可以在一笔交易里重复几千次。",
   "spoken": "合约里，多拿 1 wei 的操作，可以在一笔交易里虫复几千次。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg3-15.mp3",
   "start": 87.34,
   "dur": 5.256,
   "speechStart": 87.438,
   "speechEnd": 91.759
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-16",
   "text": "回到 Balancer。按公开分析，问题出在稳定池的批量交换里。",
   "spoken": "回到 Balancer。按公开分析，问题出在稳定池的批亮交换里。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg3-16.mp3",
   "start": 92.816,
   "dur": 6.24,
   "speechStart": 92.914,
   "speechEnd": 98.233
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-17",
   "text": "攻击者串联大量小额交换，让每一步的舍入，都朝自己累积。",
   "spoken": "攻击者串联大量小额交换，让每一步的舍入，都朝自己垒积。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg3-17.mp3",
   "start": 99.276,
   "dur": 5.544,
   "speechStart": 99.374,
   "speechEnd": 103.981
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-18",
   "text": "池子的不变量和份额价格，因此被操纵。",
   "spoken": "池子的不变量和份额价格，因此被操纵。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg3-18.mp3",
   "start": 105.04,
   "dur": 4.2,
   "speechStart": 105.138,
   "speechEnd": 108.423
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-19",
   "text": "官方估算的约 9480 万美元，按事发时估值，只算 Balancer 部署的池子。",
   "spoken": "官方估算的约 9480 万美元，按事发时估值，只算 Balancer 部署的池子。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg3-19.mp3",
   "start": 109.46,
   "dur": 6.744,
   "speechStart": 109.558,
   "speechEnd": 115.367
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-20",
   "text": "早期第三方分析的数字是约 1.28 亿美元。引用时要写明口径。",
   "spoken": "早期第三方分析的数字是约 1.28 亿美元。引用时要写明口径。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg3-20.mp3",
   "start": 116.424,
   "dur": 6.336,
   "speechStart": 116.522,
   "speechEnd": 121.924
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-21",
   "text": "再往前，2023 年 11 月，KyberSwap Elastic 也栽在方向上。",
   "spoken": "再往前，2023 年 11 月，KyberSwap Elastic 也栽在方向上。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg3-21.mp3",
   "start": 122.98,
   "dur": 5.832,
   "speechStart": 123.078,
   "speechEnd": 127.97
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-22",
   "text": "一个本该向上取整的值，被写成了向下取整。",
   "spoken": "一个本该向上取整的值，被写成了向下取整。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg3-22.mp3",
   "start": 129.032,
   "dur": 4.272,
   "speechStart": 129.13,
   "speechEnd": 132.463
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-23",
   "text": "池子误判价格没有跨过 tick，同一段流动性，被计算了两次。",
   "spoken": "池子误判价格没有跨过 tick，同一段流动性，被计算了两次。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg3-23.mp3",
   "start": 133.524,
   "dur": 5.256,
   "speechStart": 133.622,
   "speechEnd": 137.943
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-24",
   "text": "官方复盘称，受影响资产约 5620 万美元。",
   "spoken": "官方复盘称，受影响资产约 5620 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg3-24.mp3",
   "start": 139.0,
   "dur": 4.944,
   "speechStart": 139.098,
   "speechEnd": 143.098
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-25",
   "text": "教训是：单步测试里，误差可以忽略。",
   "spoken": "教训是：单步测试里，误差可以忽略。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg3-25.mp3",
   "start": 144.164,
   "dur": 4.176,
   "speechStart": 144.262,
   "speechEnd": 147.488
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-26",
   "text": "在能批量，能循环的路径里，它会被放大。",
   "spoken": "在能批亮，能循环的路径里，它会被放大。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg3-26.mp3",
   "start": 148.56,
   "dur": 4.656,
   "speechStart": 148.658,
   "speechEnd": 152.384
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-27",
   "text": "所以，要对同一操作重复 N 次，做模糊测试。",
   "spoken": "所以，要对同一操作虫复 N 次，做模糊测试。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg3-27.mp3",
   "start": 153.436,
   "dur": 4.656,
   "speechStart": 153.534,
   "speechEnd": 157.248
  }
